;; managed by the ujima image build — source: os/pipeline/desktop/i18n/catalog.edn
;;
;; GTK chooser label overrides, compiled to a .mo at stage time (desktop.i18n) and
;; installed over the distro's en_GB/en_US gtk3 catalogs — every other GTK string falls
;; back to its American msgid, accepted. "Home" -> "Temporary" states the truth: home IS
;; the tmpfs overlay upper (Files, on storage, survives reboots). The "" entry is the
;; required .mo metadata header.
{""     "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
 "Home" "Temporary"}
